@startuml login_lockouts_schema
title login_lockouts — Middleware operational table

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

entity "login_lockouts" as ll {
  * **account_number** : VARCHAR <<PK>>
  --
  failed_attempts : INTEGER
  lock_tier : INTEGER
  locked_until : TIMESTAMPTZ <<nullable>>
  permanently_locked : BOOLEAN
  must_reset_pin : BOOLEAN
  updated_at : TIMESTAMPTZ
}

note right of ll
  **Owned by middleware** (not Core Banking).
  Lock after each **3** invalid attempts.
  Timed tiers: **15 → 30** minutes (9 failures → permanent).
  Then **permanently_locked** (admin only).
  **admin_unlock()** clears locks and sets
  **must_reset_pin** until customer uses
  **POST /atm/reset-pin**.
  **reset()** deletes row on successful login
  (not while must_reset_pin is set).
  In-memory fallback if no **MIDDLEWARE_DB_URL**.
end note

@enduml
